; pq-A-agree-16 - expression matrix, AmiBlitz3 case of
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/pq-A-agree-16.bas: 1 of its 1 cells
; pq-A-agree-16.expect: the output of blitz2-ab3 -r in AB3 mode (the
; port's compiler with AmiBlitz3's libraries)
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/matrix.txt (tools/exprmatrix/README.md);
; do not edit
tq.q=0
Statement pq{x.q}
  SHARED tq
  tq=x : NPrint Hex$(Peek.l(&tq))
End Statement
Print "pq-mod-cw-cw-A " : pq{1000 MOD 1000}
End
